sentences.l:
“O friend, since you first I come upon in this place,
welcome, and may you not in anything meet me with an evil mind,
but save these things indeed, save me too;

So she spoke, and rejoiced much-enduring, heavenly Odysseus,
rejoicing in his own land, his father’s, as to him had said
Pallas Athena, the daughter of aegis-bearing Zeus;

But when I had killed him with the sharp bronze,
at once I, to a ship going, the Phoenicians, noble ones,
besought, and to them satisfying spoil I gave;

And now you by your father I entreat—for I do not think
that I have come to clear-seen Ithaca, but some other
land I am wandering about;
